              <span class="chat-who">Quillby</span>
              <p class="chat-bubble">Got it. I'll track marketing news, ad trends, and brand case studies. What platforms do you post on?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-1">
