          <p class="step-p">
            Every morning, a curated summary of what's relevant to your niche.
            Scan it in two minutes.
          </p>
          <div class="chat">
            <div class="chat-row chat-user">
              <span class="chat-who">You</span>
              <p class="chat-bubble">Give me today's brief.</p>
